    <string name="backend_shared_desc">Experimental: separate rootfs and mount namespace, but the PID namespace is shared with the host. Suitable for most devices.</string>
    <string name="backend_vm_desc">Virtual machine with its own kernel (KVM / AVF / crosvm). Launching is not implemented yet; only checks are performed.</string>
    <string name="runtime_note">The runtime currently starts a single guest userspace probe process (toybox from the image) without init or Android services, so a real launch can be verified safely.</string>
